  cmd:  { name: "반말 2 · commands with -아라/-어라/-여라", rule: "Add 라 to the 반말 form: 가 → 가라, 먹어 → 먹어라, 해 → 해라. Only to close friends and people younger than you." },
  ja:   { name: "반말 2 · proposals with -자", rule: "-자 goes straight onto the stem and never changes it: 가자, 먹자, 걷자, 듣자, 돕자, 만들자." },
